Package: lypora
Version: @VERSION@
Section: editors
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: dr-bing-li <dr-bing-li@users.noreply.github.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.31), libgtk-3-0 | libgtk-3-0t64, libnss3, libnspr4,
 libasound2 | libasound2t64, libgbm1, libxss1, libxtst6, libxkbcommon0,
 libatk-bridge2.0-0 | libatk-bridge2.0-0t64, libcups2 | libcups2t64,
 libdrm2, libexpat1, libuuid1, libx11-6, libxcb1, libxcomposite1,
 libxdamage1, libxext6, libxfixes3, libxrandr2
Recommends: fonts-noto-cjk
Suggests: xdg-utils
Homepage: https://github.com/dr-bing-li/lypora
Description: Markdown editor with instant preview
 Lypora is an independent implementation of a live-preview Markdown editor:
 what you type is rendered in place while the source stays editable.
 .
 Features: tables with draggable column widths, math (KaTeX), diagram fences,
 seven UI languages, built-in themes plus third-party Typora theme import,
 export to Markdown / HTML / PDF.
 .
 This package installs the desktop application into /opt/lypora.
